s=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREAT CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to always look the same while playing Inflafrog, because there are plenty of cosmetics to choose from! You'll first start with a small selection, but as you play though the game you will manage to unlock more and more cosmetics! So make sure to unlock them all!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hats: Give your character a little hat to make them look stylish! The hat will match your scale and stay on you at all times, so make sure to try them all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palettes: Choose 10 palettes from a large group to be displayed during your runs! Palettes are a group of colors that are used across the entire game, so not a fan of green? Just choose a red palette! There are all kinds of palettes with all kinds of vibes, so make sure to experiment a lot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Along with the visual vibes, you may change the music to whichever fits your mood at the moment! Unlike other cosmetics, you already get to enjoy all of them, so have fun picking your favorite tune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128290/extras/49ca16cba2a349fd4929e3890f43a8ef.poster.avif?t=1765374574\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128290/extras/49ca16cba2a349fd4929e3890f43a8ef.webm?t=1765374574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
